Package: hovercraft
Title: Tooltips for Shiny and bslib Pages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Harsh", "Verma", email = "125121920+insightsurge@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Hover tips for Shiny apps and bslib pages. A tip shows plain text or a named template filled from the item's own data, after the pointer rests or keyboard focus arrives. Tips are drawn by one small JavaScript file shipped with the package.
